items/pthm-fd-continuous-source-local-balances.md:131:Use step 3.1 and the stress-divergence identity, then integrate over $P_t$. The transport formula [F3] and divergence theorem [F5] recover the angular-momentum integral balance in [A1]. [F2, F3, F5, step 3.1, step 3.2, algebra]
