+## Statement
+
+Assume $\mathrm{AC}_\omega$. In the static SU(2) adjoint-Higgs sector, let $v>0$, let $\Phi/v$ converge to a smooth unit adjoint section $n_\infty$ on the sphere at spatial infinity, and assume the limiting tangential covariant derivative of $n_\infty$ vanishes. Fix the northern and southern adapted frames $u_N,u_S$ from the model definition, with $u_S=u_Nh$ on their common equator, $h(\varphi)=\exp(\theta(\varphi)T_3)$, and $\theta:[0,2\pi]\to\mathbb R$ a smooth lift. Orient the equator as the boundary of the northern hemisphere and define
