research/plan-spec.json-226661-          "statement": "On a fixed-chart end $E=\\{x\\in\\mathbb R^3:r=|x|>R_0\\}$ with the ADM convention stated below, let $u\\in C^\\infty(E,(0,\\infty))$ satisfy $u=1+m/(2r)+\\rho$, where $m\\in\\mathbb R$ has units of metres and $\\rho=O_2(r^{-2})$. Set $h=u^4\\delta$ and choose any $C^1$ symmetric tensor $K=O_1(r^{-2})$. Then the ADM limit exists in the specified chart and\n$$E_{\\mathrm{ADM}}(h;x)=\\frac{c^4m}{G_N}.$$",
research/plan-spec.json-226662-          "provenance": {
