research/plan-spec.json-227043-          "statement": "Assume Countable Choice for the smooth Lorentzian sphere-bundle convention of [[def-gr-fx-bondi-expansion]]. Let a smooth vacuum Bondi expansion be defined on an open retarded-length interval $I$. Then\n\n$$\\frac{dm_B}{du}=-\\frac1{32\\pi}\\int_{S^2}N_{AB}N^{AB}\\,d\\Omega\\le0.$$\n\nIf $dm_B/du=0$ throughout an open subinterval $J\\subset I$ and $N_{AB}$ is continuous on $J\\times S^2$, then $N_{AB}=0$ on $J\\times S^2$.",
