research/plan-spec.json-228784-          "statement": "Let a solution of a fixed evolution problem be maximal on $[0,T_{\\max})$ and satisfy the preceding continuation and bootstrap contract, with its constants $A,\\epsilon,\\eta$ and initial bound $E(0)<A\\epsilon^2$. If the bootstrap improvement holds on every compact subinterval, then $E(t)\\le A\\epsilon^2$ for all $t<T_{\\max}$. If the listed margins persist throughout the interval, then $T_{\\max}=\\infty$.",
