research/plan-spec.json-230507-          "statement": "For a complex matrix $A$, write $A^\\dagger:=\\overline A^{\\mathsf T}$. On $\\mathbb C^2$ use $\\langle u,v\\rangle:=u^\\dagger v$ and $\\|u\\|:=\\sqrt{u^\\dagger u}$, and set $SU(2):=\\{Q:Q^\\dagger Q=I,\\det Q=1\\}$. Give $M_2(\\mathbb C)$ its Euclidean topology as $\\mathbb R^8$, and define $SL(2,\\mathbb C):=\\{A\\in M_2(\\mathbb C):\\det A=1\\}$ with matrix multiplication. Then $SL(2,\\mathbb C)$ is path-connected.",
