research/plan-spec.json-231287-          "statement": "Under the assumptions of [[def-gr-fx-connection-path-transport]], if two piecewise-smooth paths $\\gamma_0,\\gamma_1:[0,1]\\to U$ are thin-homotopic in the sense of [[def-gr-fx-thin-paths]], then $U_{\\gamma_0}(1)=U_{\\gamma_1}(1)$ in the fixed tetrad trivialization.",
--
