research/plan-spec.json-238045-          "statement": "Let $d\\ge1$, let $A=A^*$ be an endomorphism of $\\mathbb C^d$ with its standard complex inner product, and let $\\hbar>0$. For real $t$, define $E_A(t):=e^{-itA/\\hbar}$ by the finite-dimensional matrix exponential defined on this page. Then $E_A(t)$ is unitary, $E_A(t+s)=E_A(t)E_A(s)$ for all real $s,t$, and its operator-norm derivative is\n$$\\frac{d}{dt}E_A(t)=-\\frac{i}{\\hbar}AE_A(t)= -\\frac{i}{\\hbar}E_A(t)A.$$",
research/plan-spec.json-238046-          "justified_by": [],
