research/plan-spec.json-238755-          "statement": "Assume Choice and Countable Choice. Fix $m,\\omega,\\hbar>0$ and let $H_{\\mathrm{osc}}$ be the self-adjoint coefficient-domain realization on $L^2(\\mathbb R,dx)$ of $-\\frac{\\hbar^2}{2m}\\frac{d^2}{dx^2}+\\frac{m\\omega^2}{2}x^2$ with normalized Hermite eigenfunctions $(\\psi_j)_{j\\ge0}$, where $H_{\\mathrm{osc}}\\psi_j=E_j\\psi_j$ and $E_j=\\hbar\\omega(j+\\frac12)$. For $n\\ge1$, let $V_n=\\operatorname{span}\\{\\psi_0,\\ldots,\\psi_{n-1}\\}\\subseteq Q(H_{\\mathrm{osc}})$. The $n$ Ritz values of the associated form on $V_n$ are exactly $E_0,\\ldots,E_{n-1}$ in increasing order, and each continuum residual $(H_{\\mathrm{osc}}-E_jI)\\psi_j$ is zero.",
research/plan-spec.json-238756-          "justified_by": [],
