research/plan-spec.json-239177-          "statement": "For the one-mode number state $|1\\rangle$ and the ideal number-count model, the mean number is $\\langle a^*a\\rangle=1$ while the normally ordered second factorial moment is $\\langle a^*a^*aa\\rangle=0$, so the assigned $g^{(2)}(0)$ statistic is zero. If the input $|1,0\\rangle$ is mixed with vacuum at the declared passive beam splitter, its output has exactly one total count, split between the two ports with probabilities $\\eta$ and $1-\\eta$. These are model predictions only; no detector realization or experimental antibunching record is asserted.",
