+---
+id: ex-qftx-su2-bps-monopole
+kind: example
+title: Unit-charge SU(2) Prasad–Sommerfield monopole profile
+status: draft
+origin: pipeline
+pipeline_run: advanced-qft-supersymmetry-build-2026-10-23
+domain: physics
